reak"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_8a4caa534a65e6f55af80564/5.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_8a4caa534a65e6f55af80564/6.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的に2番の歌詞の流れが好きなので、少しだけ共有させてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2Aのベランダ→灯りがついてる窓→2Bの会ったことないそんな他人→サビの83億人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の部分です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"主人公の考えている世界がどんどん広がっていく姿が見えて、お気に入りです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_8a4caa534a65e6f55af80564/7.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姫さま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_8a4caa534a65e6f55af80564/8.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お花いっぱいのれなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_8a4caa534a65e6f55af80564/9.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真撮ってくれてありがとね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_8a4caa534a65e6f55af80564/10.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_8a4caa534a65e6f55af80564/11.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_8a4caa534a65e6f55af80564/12.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"📷ゆづ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakamichi-biyori.pages.dev/blog/public/media/v3_8a4caa534a65e6f55af80564/13.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人に対する接し方とか、言葉遣いとか、表情で愛が伝わることってたくさんあると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、自分が愛を持って接していることと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その愛が相手にちゃんと伝わっていること、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは必ずしも同じではありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分にとってそれが愛でも、相手にとってそれはただの優しさだったりただの気遣いだと思ってしまうかもしれません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからこそ、自分の気持ちを言葉にすることが本当に大切なんだとこの楽曲に出会って気付きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言葉にすることは、ただ気持ちを伝えるだけではなくて相手に「これは愛だよ」って気付いてもらうための行動なんだと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛は、自分の中で持ってるだけじゃ完結しなくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰かに届けて、相手に伝わって、初めて繋がっていくものなんだと知りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛は一方通行じゃないんだね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Dance Practice も公開されているので、ぜひ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://youtu.be/5_ump_XVOds?si=RgGRlWS1Ua8i8wQ5"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またねん👋🏻👋🏻"}]}